--- schema docs formula ---
   60: 
   61: Use semantic commands instead of reaching into `FormatTextCommand` directly when
   62: the intent is part of the rich text feature set.
   63: 
   64: - `SetLinkCommand(url)` applies or replaces a link URL on the current selection;
   65:   `null` clears links.
   66: - `AutoLinkUrlsCommand` scans the current text block or table-cell text scope,
   67:   applies `TextAttributes.url` to detected `http(s)://` / `www.` tokens, trims
   68:   trailing punctuation, and skips ranges that already carry a link.
   69: - `ToggleMarkCommand(TextMark.remark)` toggles remark/comment anchor styling.
   70:   The same command can also toggle boolean marks such as underline and
   71:   line-through.
   72: - `InsertInlineEmbedCommand` inserts an inline embed at the caret and moves the
   73:   selection after the embed.
   74: - `WenzRichTextController.insertFormula(text)` inserts a formula embed with
   75:   `embedType: 'formula'`.
   76: - `WenzRichTextController.insertMention(id, label)` inserts a mention embed with
   77:   `embedType: 'mention'` and renders as `@label`.
   78: - `WenzRichTextController.insertEmoji(emoji, shortName: ...)` inserts an emoji
   79:   embed with `embedType: 'emoji'`; JSON stores the unicode value and optional
   80:   short name while default renderers display the emoji character.
   81: - `WenzRichTextController.insertInlineImage(...)` inserts an inline image embed
   82:   with `embedType: 'image'` and renders as `[img]` until a media renderer is
   83:   provided.
   84: 
   85: ## Comment threads
   86: 
   87: `ADV-023` introduces the storage and UI contract for comments without adding
   88: comment mutation commands yet:
   89: 
   90: - `RichTextDocument.comments` stores `CommentThread` records in rich JSON.

